=3 Notes
* As {p:thieves|THF}, Qiqirn Egglers are highly evasive, attack quickly and can {p:Triple Attack}.

=2 Walkthrough
Destroy the Qiqirn while keeping the Apkallu healed.
* All Apkallu are curable and buffable.
* Smaller apkallu are female. They will not aid the players.
** The assault is a failure if all female Apkallu are defeated.
* Larger apkallu are male. They will automatically attack any nearby Qiqirn.
** If they are damaged beyond 50%, they will fall over and stop aiding the party.
* Qiqirn will slowly approach in pairs or solo from the east and west side; player should not stray too far from the gaggle of apkallus.
* Drag the Qiqirn through the middle of the pack of Apkallu to get the male Apkallu assisting in the fight.

The {p:Rune of Release} will spawn at (I-8) when all 15 of the Qiqirn are defeated.
* More qiqirn will keep spawning until the 15 kill objective is achieved, then the assault ends and remaining qiqirn will despawn.

